---
title: "ADL registry lifecycle (Current Finance: Auto-Deleverage)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_enable_col: enable_collateral_deleverage(params, activation_ts)
    q_enable_col --> q_check_no_dup: assert coin not already in collaterals
    q_check_no_dup --> q_timelock: TimeLock(params, timestamp)
    q_timelock --> q_store_col: collaterals.store(timelock)
    q_store_col --> q_active: ADL active

    [*] --> q_enable_borrow: enable_debt_deleverage(emode, params, activation_ts)
    q_enable_borrow --> q_check_emode: create borrows[emode] if not exists
    q_check_emode --> q_check_no_dup_b: assert coin not in borrows[emode]
    q_check_no_dup_b --> q_timelock_b: TimeLock(params, timestamp)
    q_timelock_b --> q_store_b: borrows[emode].store(timelock)
    q_store_b --> q_active

    q_active --> q_try_stop_col: try_stop_collateral_deleverage(current_deposit)
    q_try_stop_col --> q_check_target: target_amount lt current_value?
    q_check_target --> q_still_active: still above target, continue ADL
    q_check_target --> q_remove: remove from registry + emit ADLDeactivated
    q_remove --> [*]
    q_still_active --> [*]

    q_active --> q_try_stop_borrow: try_stop_borrow_deleverage(emode, current_borrow)
    q_try_stop_borrow --> q_check_target_b: target_amount lt current_value?
    q_check_target_b --> q_still_active_b: still above target
    q_check_target_b --> q_remove_b: remove from borrows[emode]
    q_remove_b --> [*]
    q_still_active_b --> [*]

    note right of q_active
        INV-001: ADL has separate collateral and borrow deleverage registries
        INV-002: Borrow deleverage is per-emode-group per-asset
        INV-003: ADL auto-deactivates on repay/withdraw when below target
        INV-004: TimeLock enables time-based parameter progression (ltv drops, incentive rises)
        INV-005: Only admin (with ADL permission) can enable ADL
    end note
